# ==============================================================================
# RAFIK — CONFIGURATION DIRECTORY POINTERS
# ==============================================================================
# The Node.js Express backend and root .env have been decommissioned.
# Rafik is a pure Supabase Cloud architecture (Auth, PostgreSQL, RLS, Storage, Realtime).
#
# Client configuration is maintained in:
# 1. Mobile App (Flutter):
#    mobile_app/env/example.json -> Copy to mobile_app/env/dev.json
#    Run with: flutter run --flavor rider --dart-define-from-file=env/dev.json
#
# 2. Admin Web Portal (Static):
#    admin_portal/config.example.js -> Copy to admin_portal/config.js
#    Deploy directly to Cloudflare Pages, Netlify, or Vercel.
#
# Secrets Policy:
# Never put service_role keys, database passwords, or private keys in client applications.
# Clients only use publishable anon keys with Row Level Security (RLS) enforcement.
# ==============================================================================
